        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "만드라고라",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_233_1#8",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "빌어먹을, 빌어먹을…… 돌기둥, 빨리, 저들을 뚫어버려! 저 살카즈들을!"
